{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52937","headline":"题石门 · 释玄宗","name":"题石门","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"双扉啓（《咸淳临安志》作「起」）岩石，尘客过应稀。\n千古掩不得，从教云夜归。\n（见清释广宾《西天目祖山志》卷五）（按：此诗最早见收於南宋潜说友《咸淳临安志》卷二十六，谓「世传唐玄宗有诗」云云。\n明皇平行迹未及东南，诗显非其所作。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"释玄宗","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52937.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52937","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}